while I'm here, I've got ADD.

00:08:52.070 --> 00:08:53.130
- I thought that was going to help.

00:08:53.130 --> 00:08:54.600
- No, no, put that away.

00:08:54.600 --> 00:08:56.330
You have to be still Gary.

00:08:56.330 --> 00:08:57.313
Be still.

