00:09:00.360 --> 00:09:01.969
- [Jameela] We're going to fight.

00:09:01.969 --> 00:09:03.730
- We're not going to fight, we're happy.

00:09:03.730 --> 00:09:05.970
I'm just fidgeting with my toes right now.

00:09:05.970 --> 00:09:09.560
- Yeah, yeah, I'm just
big on asking what I need.

00:09:09.560 --> 00:09:10.980
- Listen, I am thrilled,

00:09:10.980 --> 00:09:12.910
I'm very good at delivering
