00:09:12.910 --> 00:09:14.680
so keep going.
- That's amazing.

00:09:14.680 --> 00:09:15.890
Okay, so where was I?

00:09:15.890 --> 00:09:17.790
- You were talking about thinspiration

00:09:17.790 --> 00:09:18.877
