00:09:18.877 --> 00:09:19.737
You go to think.

00:09:19.737 --> 00:09:22.360
- So when I was lucky
enough to get better,

00:09:22.360 --> 00:09:24.160
I realized that I disrespected my body

00:09:24.160 --> 00:09:25.645
